### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Verify UID and server
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "uid": "123456789", "server": "TW-01" }

### Create MyCard payment order (TWD)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-order-001

{ "uid": "123456789", "server": "TW-01", "productCode": "PACK-001", "amountTwd": 100 }

### Check order status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID
